    {
      "date": "Mar 02 2026",
      "text": "The application to vacate the Ninth Circuit's stay presented to Justice Kagan and by her referred to the Court is granted as to the parents but is otherwise denied. Opinion per curiam. (Detached Opinion ). Justice Thomas and Justice Alito would grant the application in full. Justice Sotomayor would deny the application in full. Justice Barrett, with whom The Chief Justice and Justice Kavanaugh join, concurs. (Detached opinion ). Justice Kagan, with whom Justice Jackson joins, dissents. (Detached Opinion )",
